  "summary": "Malicious code in testingflow2 (npm)",
  "details": "Testingflow2@1.0.0 is a dependency-substitution package. It declares a dependency on \"fast-utils-core\" resolved from the attacker-controlled URL hxxps://artifacts[.]stg[.]yosiroute[.]com/npm/fast-utils-core instead of the public npm registry. When installed, npm fetches the dependency from this external server, giving the attacker arbitrary code execution in the installer's context. The package itself is a trivial stub with no functional code; its sole purpose is to hijack the dependency resolution.",
